何百回の夜を過ごしたって得られないような愛を知ってる 並べてみて
Knowing a love so peerless you couldn't find it even after spending hundreds of nights, line them up and see.

268
00:36:26,577 --> 00:36:35,377
何千回の夜を過ごしたって得られないような最高のプロポーズをちょうだい
Give me the ultimate proposal, the kind you can't get even after spending thousands of nights.

269
