[Title: 晴る
作詞・作曲:in-buna]
[Title: Haru
Lyrics & Music: n-buna]

277
00:38:24,472 --> 00:38:33,122
あなたは風のように目を閉じて歩いて
You walked with your eyes closed like the wind,

278
00:38:33,702 --> 00:38:37,802
何を想っているんだろう
What could you be thinking about?

279
00:38:44,525 --> 00:38:51,895
まぶたを開いていたあなたの目はきっと
Your eyes, when you opened your eyelids, surely...

280
00:38:52,565 --> 00:38:57,775
少しだけ春の匂いがした
carried just a hint of spring's scent.

281
00:39:04,955 --> 00:39:09,365
晴れ間に跳ね 悩ましげに
Leaping into the sunny breaks, looking troubled,

282
00:39:09,765 --> 00:39:14,035
咲いて春のせい
blooming, it's spring's fault.

283
00:39:14,535 --> 00:39:18,515
振り向けるな、まばたきでさえ
Don't look back, even with a blink,

284
00:39:18,935 --> 00:39:23,045
あなたを語る春を
the spring that speaks of you.

285
00:39:23,565 --> 00:39:28,055
胸を打つような夜けれど
Though it's a night that strikes the heart,

286
00:39:28,365 --> 00:39:32,035
まあ晴る風
well, a clearing spring breeze.

287
00:39:32,815 --> 00:39:38,105
あなたを追い越してゆけ 僕のまだまだ遠くまで
Overtake you and keep going, far, far away into my future.

288
00:39:38,895 --> 00:39:41,855
僕のまだまだ遠くまで
Far, far away into my future.

289
00:39:49,652 --> 00:39:57,602
あなたは晴れるように目を閉じてわらうような
Like clearing skies, you closed your eyes and smiled,

290
00:39:57,922 --> 00:40:02,622
何かしらののだろうか
I wonder what it could be.

291
00:40:08,039 --> 00:40:12,359
瞼をひらいている あなたの目にきっと
Opening your eyelids, surely in your eyes...

292
00:40:17,499 --> 00:40:22,959
ひまさえ少し雨の匂いがした
Even the spare moments smelled slightly of rain.

293
00:40:29,229 --> 00:40:34,129
泣き出しそうなた空だよ
The sky looks like it's about to cry.

294
00:40:34,609 --> 00:40:39,229
咲け 雨のせい
Bloom, blame it on the rain.

295
00:40:39,629 --> 00:40:47,549
降りしきる雨でさえ 雲の上では晴る
Even the ceaseless rain is sunny above the clouds.

296
00:40:48,569 --> 00:40:56,709
土煙るほどよのれ ほら春がはえ
Dance up a dust storm, look, spring is blooming.

297
00:40:57,629 --> 00:41:06,429
あの海も越えてゆく 遠くの遠くまで
Crossing over that sea as well, far, far away.

298
00:41:23,629 --> 00:41:28,149
取り残され草を靡かせ
Leaving behind swaying grass...

299
00:41:28,829 --> 00:41:33,029
羊雲もあれも春のせい
Even those sheep clouds are because of spring.

300
00:41:33,429 --> 00:41:41,769
風のよ胸に春のせ 春を待つ
Spring in my heart like the wind, waiting for spring.

301
00:41:47,629 --> 00:41:55,869
晴れに晴れ空よ咲け 冴えて春のせい
Clear and clear, sky bloom brightly, cleanly due to spring.

302
00:41:56,629 --> 00:42:05,369
降り止まねば雨でさえ あなたをかざる春
Even unceasing rain decorates you this spring.

303
00:42:06,029 --> 00:42:15,089
胸を打つ音奏でて ほら春がはえ
Playing the sound that beats my heart, look, spring is blooming.

304
00:42:15,629 --> 00:42:24,429
音に聴く春の風 さあこの歌よ投げ
The spring wind heard in sound, come, cast this song.

305
00:42:25,229 --> 00:42:34,189
晴れに晴れ花よ咲け 冴えて春のせい
Clear and clear, flowers bloom, cleanly due to spring.

306
00:42:34,629 --> 00:42:44,289
あの雲も越えてゆく 遠くまた遠くまで
Crossing over those clouds too, far and far away.

307
