どこからくれば良いものが うまいものが まずいものが
Where should good things, delicious things, bad things come from?

309
00:43:31,168 --> 00:43:37,748
さっぱり俺にはわからない 気まかりばかりの中じゃん
I haven't a clue at all, in the middle of all this caprice.

310
00:43:38,328 --> 00:43:44,708
仏がいつも見つをさす 貫するのが礼儀でしょ
Buddha always points the way, piercing through is proper etiquette.

311
00:43:45,328 --> 00:43:49,188
苦味が好みをおそそのかす
Bitterness instigates our preferences.

312
00:43:49,628 --> 00:43:53,008
お先にどうそ遠慮なく
Please go ahead without hesitation.

313
00:43:53,328 --> 00:43:57,768
ああ開き家やそのお口 宴 宴が始まって
Ah, open wide those mouths, the banquet, the banquet has begun.

314
00:43:58,328 --> 00:44:04,248
もったいねえや一刻きみ 好きなものだけ食べな晴れ
What a waste, moment by moment, eat only what you like.

315
00:44:04,928 --> 00:44:07,708
宴 宴が始まって
The banquet, the banquet has begun...

316
00:44:22,328 --> 00:44:30,168
ああどっちをめくりゃよいものか 白いふだ 黒いふだ
Ah, which one should I turn over? White talisman, black talisman.

317
00:44:30,628 --> 00:44:36,708
いっちょ賭けるとしようかが 死ぬも生きるも紙一重
Shall I place a bet? Whether dying or living is razor-thin.

318
00:44:37,328 --> 00:44:40,948
お釈迦が雲の糸垂らす
Buddha lets down a spider's thread.

319
00:44:41,328 --> 00:44:44,748
遅くはないわお引きなさい
It's not too late, pull back.

320
00:44:45,328 --> 00:44:52,048
地獄の声が耳を打つ 踏み外すのも悪くない
The voice of hell strikes my ears, stepping off isn't so bad either.

321
00:44:52,328 --> 00:44:56,708
あまっさかりよこの宴 今宵 今宵は帰さんで
At its peak, this banquet—tonight, tonight I won't let you go home.

322
00:44:57,328 --> 00:45:02,268
縁だけは赤よろしく 踊れや踊れ
Make ties red and propitious, dance and dance!

323
