落ちる　どこまで　落ちなはれ
Falling down, falling all the way down!

325
00:45:11,162 --> 00:45:14,012
回れ　回れや　ひらけ　ひらけや
Spin around, spin around, open up, open up!

326
00:45:17,912 --> 00:45:21,112
回れ　回れや　ひらけ　ひらけや
Spin around, spin around, open up, open up!

327
00:45:21,912 --> 00:45:25,212
回れ　回れや　ひらけ　ひらけや
Spin around, spin around, open up, open up!

328
00:45:26,012 --> 00:45:29,162
回れ　回れや　ひらけ　ひらけや
Spin around, spin around, open up, open up!

329
00:45:32,812 --> 00:45:35,812
回れ　回れや　ひらけ　ひらけや
Spin around, spin around, open up, open up!

330
00:45:36,312 --> 00:45:39,712
赤っ恥かきや　そのお口
Making a fool of yourself, with that mouth of yours

331
00:45:40,012 --> 00:45:43,412
宴　宴が始まって
The banquet, the banquet is beginning

332
