337
00:46:28,112 --> 00:46:32,012
苦しいほど重いこの衝動を拾う　欲深そうな諍いも勝手にわなろうか
Picking up this agonizingly heavy impulse, shall we take even greedy disputes as they come?

338
00:46:32,012 --> 00:46:35,012
あこがれに焦がれまま燃やし続けている
Continuing to burn while yearning for what we long for

339
